                "In this masterclass capstone, you assume the executive position of Vice President of Production Infrastructure and Platform Operations for Apex Intelligence Laboratories. Your mission is to architect, construct, execute, and certify the ApexContinuousServing Engine: a unified, production-grade serving platform that integrates iteration-level continuous batching, chunked prefill co-scheduling, bucketed CUDA Graph dispatch, and real-time SLA telemetry into a single, cohesive Python architecture.",
